p1 meta lang.pattern.p1 stated "show a kanban board in the terminal => concept board.purpose \"a kanban board printed in the terminal\"" @gen:7479c8d25412d85e
p2 meta lang.pattern.p2 stated "read the board from the file named on the command line, or from standard input when no file is named => fact input.source \"command line file or standard input\"" @gen:7479c8d25412d85e
p3 meta lang.pattern.p3 stated "the board is markdown: a <col> line opens a column and a <card> line under it is one of its cards => fact board.syntax \"<col> <card>\"" @gen:7479c8d25412d85e
p4 meta lang.pattern.p4 stated "the board has the columns <names> => fact board.columns \"<names>\"" @gen:7479c8d25412d85e
p5 meta lang.pattern.p5 stated "print one line per column: its name, a colon, a space, then its cards joined with <sep> => fact output.separator \"<sep>\"" @gen:7479c8d25412d85e
p6 meta lang.pattern.p6 stated "a column with no cards prints its name and the colon only => fact output.empty \"name and colon only\"" @gen:7479c8d25412d85e
p7 meta lang.pattern.p7 stated "install the tool as the command <name> => fact tool.command \"<name>\"" @gen:7479c8d25412d85e
p8 meta lang.pattern.p8 stated "given the lines <l.list:,|and> print the lines <o.list:,|and> => fact witness.example \"an example board and the lines it must print\" ; fact witness.feed.<l:index> \"<l>\" ; fact witness.out.<o:index> \"<o>\"" @gen:7479c8d25412d85e
